        "label": "🌿 Cottagecore Dream",
        "prompt": "Cottagecore aesthetic, soft pastel colors, wildflowers and greenery, cozy countryside vibes, handmade artisan feel, warm natural lighting, vintage charm, peaceful rural setting, watercolor style, whimsical and romantic, sustainable living aesthetic",
        "temperature": 0.8,
        "style": "cottagecore"
      }
    },
    {
